\vspace{0.5cm}

Draw the Venn diagram for the symmetric difference of $A = \{1,3,5\}$ and $B = \{1,2,3\}$.
Also compute $A \oplus B$.

\vspace{0.3cm}
\textcolor{primaryblue}{\textbf{Solution:}}

\vspace{0.3cm}
\textbf{Step 1: Identify the regions.}
\begin{itemize}[leftmargin=1.5em]
    \item $A \cap B = \{1,3\}$ \quad (in both --- \textbf{not} in symmetric difference)
    \item $A - B = \{5\}$ \quad (only in $A$ --- \textbf{in} symmetric difference)
    \item $B - A = \{2\}$ \quad (only in $B$ --- \textbf{in} symmetric difference)
\end{itemize}

\textbf{Step 2: Compute $A \oplus B$.}
\[
    A \oplus B = (A - B) \cup (B - A) = \{5\} \cup \{2\} = \boxed{\{2,5\}}
\]

\vspace{0.3cm}
\textbf{Step 3: Venn diagram placement.}

