    \item The divisibility poset $(\mathbb{Z}^+, \mid)$ appears in
          \textbf{Number Theory} (Chapter~3) for GCD and LCM calculations,
          where $\gcd(a,b) = $ GLB and $\text{lcm}(a,b) = $ LUB.
